UID:fjqOSLOiVS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nFor the 21st consecutive year\, S
 hortsTV presents the Oscar-Nominated Short Films\, opening on February 20.
  With all three categories offered – Animated\, Live Action\, and Docume
 ntary – this is your annual chance to predict the winners (and have the 
 edge in your Oscar pool)! A perennial hit with audiences around the countr
 y and the world\, don’t miss this year’s selection of shorts. The Acad
 emy Awards take place Sunday\, March 15.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in
 -theaters/2026-oscar-nominated-shorts/2026-oscar-nominated-shorts-animatio
 n\n\nEstimated start: 12:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
